  en: {"aiHelpPaceRefused":"Wait a little before asking again: one question every 5 minutes, 10 a day.","aiImageGuard":"Block harmful images","aiImageGuardHelp":"Checks each image of a member before it appears. An image the AI finds or suspects harmful is blocked. The AI can make mistakes.","aiImageGuardCategories":"What to block","aiGuardSexual":"Sexual content","aiGuardViolence":"Violence","aiGuardSelfHarm":"Self-harm","aiGuardHate":"Hate and extremism","aiGuardHarassment":"Harassment","aiGuardSpam":"Spam and scams","aiBadgeFree":"Free","aiBadgePaid":"Paid","aiImageGuardCost":"Free: OpenAI's moderation filter, with your OpenAI key, whatever the provider. Paid: one request to your provider per image.","aiImageGuardHold":"Held, never shown: images with personal data (never sent), and any image the AI cannot check (no key, limit reached, provider down). Moderators and trusted members are not checked.","aiImageGuardDelete":"Delete the Discord message too","aiImageGuardDeleteHelp":"Requires Manage Messages.","aiImageGuardAnimated":"Also check GIFs and videos","aiImageGuardAnimatedHelp":"Three frames of each file are checked, so up to three requests.","aiFreeKeyHint":"With Anthropic, the OpenAI key is used only for OpenAI's free image filter.","aiPersonalRelay":"Ask the AI when the scan finds nothing","aiPersonalRelayHelp":"Your AI provider looks for anything that could locate or identify someone: a house number, a street sign, a plate, a document, a screen. One paid request per image. Data the local scan finds is never sent.","aiPersonalScope":"Images sent to the AI","aiPersonalPhotos":"Photos","aiPersonalScreenshots":"Screenshots","aiPersonalVideos":"GIFs and videos (3 frames)","aiPersonalIncomplete":"Images the scan could not finish","aiPersonalNeedsProvider":"Choose an AI provider in AI assistant first.","reasonAiImage":"held by the AI image check","reasonAiPersonalData":"personal data seen by the AI","reasonAiImageBlocked":"blocked by the AI image check","whyAiImage":"The AI image check had a doubt about this image, or could not check it (no key, limit reached, provider down). It waits for you: approve it if it is fine.","whyAiPersonalData":"This image may show where someone lives or who they are (address, street sign, plate, document, screen). It waits for you: approve it only if nothing private shows.","whyAiImageBlocked":"The AI found or suspected harmful content in this image, so it was blocked before it appeared. The AI can make mistakes.","reasonAiImageUnchecked":"held: the AI could not check it","whyAiImageUnchecked":"The AI could not check this image (no key, limit reached, provider down, or a file it cannot read). It waits for you: approve it if it is fine."},
